{"reviewId": "224636901_8bjdKnEWY", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "作为投资者，不要只盯着CPI（消费者物价）看。CPI是“牛鞭的手柄”，反应最迟钝。如果你等CPI大涨才去买资源股，黄花菜都凉了。要盯着PPI（出厂价格）和原材料价格，那是“鞭梢”，是春江水暖鸭先知的地方。\nCPI：消费者物价指数（Consumer Price Index）\n是站在老百姓、消费者的角度看物价，统计的是：你日常买的东西价格涨没涨（吃、穿、住（房租）、交通、医疗、教育等）。\nCPI 高 = 生活成本变贵 = 通胀\nCPI 低 = 东西便宜 / 经济偏冷\nPPI：生产者物价指数（Producer Price Index）\n是站在工厂、企业、生产者的角度看物价，统计的是：企业生产时原材料、出厂价涨没涨（钢材、煤炭、化工、农产品、工厂出厂价等）\nPPI 高 = 企业生产成本变高\nPPI 是上游，CPI 是下游。如果原料涨价（PPI↑）→ 工厂涨价 → 商品涨价（CPI↑）", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "11301-11312", "abstract": "9　生产过程的价格波动", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "224636901_8bjdKnEWY", "userVid": 224636901, "topics": [], "createTime": 1786550405, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 224636901, "name": "北山杉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/H0Ao7VtiaVxMFQGlRYQQzjqmrAsBsqsfgKjgUZD7v8k6tHGRNTvJn603TOfppOIqxjUsXg2dMqtE4dztlaicyu2ZNNDMhvRLKTTuzicvlIERyE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 392731170, "name": "无欲则刚", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0006-1_WjrjTyNV2~h5D4gh_Jofa/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "无欲则刚", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "先完成再完美/上士闻道，勤而行之。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle